The schema_v0 field mapping in freeze_record and _normal_source adapts the
published Agora reference emitter. The remaining outbox and delivery code
was written for this connector. Inspeximus and the MemStrata engine are not
bundled in this distribution.

Upstream contract and emitter inspected at:
https://github.com/DanceNitra/agora/blob/d7431a5319a84be8acb79db2b6305ae1035ca3d9/research/schema_v0.json
https://github.com/DanceNitra/agora/blob/d7431a5319a84be8acb79db2b6305ae1035ca3d9/research/probes/schema_v0_emit.py

